topics.text:
Ten attributes shape everything you do. Your class decides which one powers your attacks and spells.

{list:attributes}

Level-ups give attribute points to spend on the Status screen. Gear, talents, buffs and debuffs add to (or take from) your attributes in battle.

Twelve classes in four schools. [b]Attack power[/b] uses the class's primary physical attribute; [b]spell power[/b] its primary magical one ("balanced" = Intelligence + Faith + Arcane).

{list:classes}

Each class has three talent branches (Talents screen) that end in an ultimate skill.

[b]Elites[/b] (★ on their panel) are tougher enemies with an affix. They pay {x:elites:settings.gold_mult} gold.

{list:elite_affixes}

[b]Bosses[/b] end every floor. They have a signature skill and an ultimate, charge them up at HP thresholds, and need more weakness hits to Break.

[b]Omens[/b] are optional: after choosing a floor you may take up to {num:omens:max_omens}. Each makes the run harder and adds to its gold and materials.

{list:omens}

[b]Boons:[/b] after each boss you pick 1 of {num:boons:offer_count}. They last until you return to town.

{list:boons}
